  "mechanism": "During soft Ping timeout quarantine, retire the lost Ping outside its callback and probe on the same transport with a fresh context ID. Interval is configured Ping interval clamped to 50ms..1s; matching Ack recovers soft quarantine. Wrong/old Ack cannot confirm it. Ten-second expiry and transport-error fallback remain.",
  "scheduling": "Probe deadlines advance from max(previous probe deadline, Now), keeping successive retries apart. Probes do not report service deadlines for another selected server priority.",
  "validation": {
    "focused_ctest": "3/3 passed: request-response, ping-push-ack, presence-api",
    "regression_tests": [
      "Automatic probe before expiry without disconnect",
      "Old Ack rejected and replacement Ack recovers same connection",
      "Existing late-Ack recovery, hard transport failure, expiry and P2P receive regression cases"
    ],
    "known_base_failure": "As previously reproduced: test-server-connection persistence priority roundtrip segfaults on base too; full suite is not claimed green."
  },
